00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:37.460
November, 1587 - Yamashiro Province - Yamashina

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:09.160
One sen per horse - Hechikan.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:11.860
The Cursed Night

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:22.530
The Emperor  has acknowledged you as the number one aesthete.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:27.580
Please accept the Chief Advisor's medal of honor.

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:32.040
Or else you will be making him lose face.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:37.370
You've read the sign outside, Rikyū.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:47.320
Just put one sen for each of your horses into that container. That's all.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:51.260
That's more than enough for me.

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.780
What are you doing?

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.380
My days are numbered.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:04.330
I am taking care of my belongings one by one.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:09.300
Aren't you at that age, too?
Don't you also have things you need to take care of?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.040
Once you pass away, your sense of refinement goes with you.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.450
I don't agree.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.300
So you've committed plenty of sins?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.730
Much more than the Chief Advisor?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.750
That is correct.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.840
However,

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:42.300
if my sins are able to paint the world with imperfection,

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.930
and allow everyone to experience the beauty of transience,

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:54.600
then I can erase the demons in my heart and live peacefully.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:04:02.260
That is my mission. My reason for living.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:09.710
I guess twenty years can truly change a person.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:17.870
You were once full of wisdom and quite passionate.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:22.320
I never expected you to be so concerned about worldly matters.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.230
I guess you've talked with Furuori already?

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:30.570
"Too much of one thing is never good."

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:35.490
That line also fits you perfectly, if I dare say.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.930
One finds it hardest to judge oneself.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:49.080
I probably won't have a chance to see you again, so let me tell you this now.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:54.330
There is a limit to human ambition.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:05:00.690
Are you saying that I am not able to let everyone understand the beauty of imperfection?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:09.090
One who does not know his limits invites disaster.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:16.800
Maybe you're thinking of relying on your karma to pull you through?

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.360
However...

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:27.560
Tanaka Yoshiro, or rather, Master Rikyū.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.420
You are being swallowed by the hellfire.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:48.500
January, 1588 - Kyoto, Jurakudai - Ueda Satarō's Residence

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.830
Odawara reeks of gunpowder.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:04.570
I've heard rumors that Hōjō did not visit for New Year's because he was preparing for war.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:13.000
What Toyotomi fears most is if Hōjō becomes allies with Date from Ōu.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:17.140
That is what I fear, too.

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:23.940
I have this feeling that I will perish if a war breaks out.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:33.550
I was like a tied-down horse, unable to take action without some sort of bait.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:40.940
But since last year's tea ceremony, I have been lacking in any sort of ambition.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:46.900
Forget about martial arts. Even aesthetics have forsakened me.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:53.110
No matter what, I must find something that will light the flames in my heart once again before war breaks out.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.440
Can you come with me for minute?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.030
I want to see some things I'm interested in.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.640
Sure.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.830
But isn't this getting a bit desperate?

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:14.010
You're actively trying to seek out anything to awaken your senses?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.390
You mere servant!

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.720
Do you not understand the intricacies of one's heart?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.500
I got scolded?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.660
Why?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.860
Is he treating me like I'm his servant already?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:32.470
Kōzan Temple has been growing tea leaves since the times of Zen master Eisai.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.680
Every year they give me a little bit of their new tea.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.560
We are the ones who should be thanking you.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:42.730
You have donated quite a bit of your money to us.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:48.240
So what did you want to see here? I'm guessing it's some interesting tea bowl?

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:52.630
No. I'm past that already.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:01.740
A frog is wrestling with a rabbit!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.500
My-My sides...

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:07.530
Lord Ueda is so honest with himself.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:16.300
This foolish painting of animals is more boring than I expected.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.680
I can tell the artist is master of satire.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.230
The brush skillfully releases the painter's ability.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:33.150
But this is unable to make me split my sides in laughter.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.960
This is not what I want.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:40.370
So what do you think is funny, then?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.130
Follow me.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.050
My sides!

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.600
What do you see in this Nio statue?

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.710
Can't you tell from that face he's making?

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:59.720
A man cannot contort his body like that!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:04.200
The sculptor realized that and yet sculpted it anyway!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:08.870
He went full-blown overboard with the contortions!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:13.480
I'm sure the sculptor went all out!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.450
This is just like...

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:27.700
Even if you are a warrior, you will be punished for laughing at the gods!

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:28.560
Lord Ueda!

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:29.910
Stop right there!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.720
I may have gotten a laugh out of that, but it wasn't what I wanted.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:38.230
My ambitions still lie with the tea ceremony, I suspect.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:43.520
The act of pouring the tea allows even my nose and tongue to get in on the action.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:50.290
This trip has been quite refreshing, though.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:54.910
February, 1588 - Kawachi Province - Moriguchi

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:17.830
Are you saying that I am not able to let everyone understand the beauty of imperfection?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.050
Master Rikyū, it's this way.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.070
There's a place I want to go to.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.330
I've already told my family. Please do not worry.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:42.160
What a surprise, Master Rikyū.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:44.620
You should have told me earlier that you were coming.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.460
I was heading for the capital when I remembered about you.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.010
I'll guide you to the tea room.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.110
Delicious...

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:30.730
A meal using just yuzu miso... It warms my heart.

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:33.080
I'm truly sorry.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.280
Let me prepare you something from the grill.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:47.120
He keeps his residence nice and tidy.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.030
His treatment of guests, even if they come unannounced, is superb.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.860
He is a true aesthete on imperfection.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:12:03.320
I am not mistaken, Master Hechikan.

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.990
The beauty of imperfection has taken root in this world already.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.870
Please take your time and enjoy.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.470
Kamaboko is rare among the common people.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.180
How did you get these?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.590
I had them sent by express from Osaka yesterday.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.440
I understand everything now.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.200
You already knew I was coming.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:40.910
Everything, from your feigned surprise, was planned.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:44.980
I know your family well, Master Rikyū.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:51.940
I cannot treat you with disrespect, out of the blue.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.640
I am truly sorry.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:13.420
Am I destined to remain just a tea master who peddles in sham imperfection?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.340
It's so cold.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.860
March, 1588 - Izu Province - Atami

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:32.880
Please give that to my son, Iseya Doshichi.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:38.640
I wouldn't mind if you tell him it's from me, Yamanoue Sōji.

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:45.400
So you want me to keep this a secret from the other merchants?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.560
Yes.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.760
Everything relating to my tea ceremony skills is in this.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.530
Please!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:14:01.620
Thank you for meeting with me even after I left Mount Kōya,

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.870
Master Hōjō Genan.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.340
You finally came, Master Sōji.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:14.030
War is about to break out with Toyotomi.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:20.410
It's been a while since my letter.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.560
My mind was wavering.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.790
But as I traveled across the land,

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:38.620
I've realized the place I belong is not with the Chief Advisor.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.720
Do you hate Hideyoshi that much?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:49.860
His sense of imperfection is too different from mine.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.940
You are quite a stubborn man, like what I've heard.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.300
I descended from the great Sōun.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:04.610
I may be in hiding, but I kept my Hōjō name.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:09.180
90 years passed by in a flash.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.130
If a true aesthete like me croaks,

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:17.780
the entire province of Sagami will lose their refined tastes.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.810
That is the only thing I am worried about.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:27.570
Please convert them all with your newfound imperfection.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.120
Master Sōji.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.650
So he is Yamanoue Sōji.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.750
Rikyū's number one disciple!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.780
Please take a look at my Kamakura sculpture!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.120
Please give us your advice, Master Sōji!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.190
Please! You must! Master Sōji!

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.160
April, 1588 - Kyoto, Imperial Palace

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:33.230
Finally... Finally the Emperor is visiting my Jurakudai!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.480
Nobunaga's Azuchi Castle never got an Imperial visit!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.590
Now he is heading towards my residence!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.870
This is beyond the Triumvirate!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:48.730
Another wish of mine is coming true.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:54.410
Things will go as how the Emperor wants.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:59.970
Then it's time for you to become a Buddha, my Emperor.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:03.640
Watch over this monkey from Nirvana!

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:08.560
Toyotomi's future is rock solid now, Brother.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:13.680
We have the new Emperor right in our hands.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:19.410
But I, Hidenaga, am so bad.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:29.490
Prince Masahito died of sickness, and yet I feel a sense of happiness.

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:32.400
I was prepared for this,

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:36.280
but his death won't be in vain.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.200
How's it going with Odawara?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:45.710
I urged him to visit the capital, but Hōjō is stubborn.

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.750
Pardon me for being forward, but let me say this.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:52.040
You are working for the Chief Advisor this time.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.360
Don't mess up your chance to shine.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.530
Or else...

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:04.170
Lord Nobunaga, you may be suspected of leaning for Toyotomi again.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:11.200
Please check through every piece of mail from Odawara.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:19.090
If there is anything fishy, make sure to report to me.

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:38.080
This is a very strong sake.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:44.220
Amano sake has a pure golden color. It is the best sake in the world.

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:49.370
Let me dilute it down a bit for your tastes.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:56.660
I will make sure to return what I owe you.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.210
No need to be so hasty.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:06.170
Now that we're here at the capital,
aren't you going to see the Chief Advisor's wife?

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.380
I'll pass this time.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.660
I have prepared many different kinds of sake for the Emperor.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.550
To celebrate a long and lasting relationship,

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:24.890
please have a taste, Lord Tokugawa.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.520
You tried out all of them already?

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:32.500
I've been looking for something to get attached to lately.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:36.340
I spent seven days drinking them all.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.520
Here. Have a taste.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.050
I may upset my stomach.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.970
The sake you are used to is sufficient.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:55.230
I'm sure the capital's sake is great, but the clear sake from Azuchi Castle is too luxurious.

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.820
I apologize for what happened last time.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:07.410
But clear sake is nothing out of the ordinary anymore.

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:10.180
This is from Itami, Settsu Province.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.550
Have a taste.

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:20.750
Marvelous!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:28.670
The Bodai water and Amano sake from Azuchi Castle are temple sake that cannot be bought by normal folk.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:33.720
But this distilled by commoners. The price is very reasonable.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.930
This is suitable for everyday drinking.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:43.670
Due to the influence of my late brother, Nakagawa Kiyohide, I can amass a huge stock of this.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:48.310
I'm sure this fits your tastes, Lord Tokugawa.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:53.770
You want to pay off all of your debts with this?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:57.800
This is s symbol of our long-lasting friendship.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:04.440
It is not too fancy, the price is right, and it is delicious.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:09.250
Perhaps this is what Master Rikyū's imperfection is all about.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.520
Please don't talk about imperfection anymore.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.110
It reminds me of my own immaturity.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.950
What's the matter, milord?

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:03.870
I'm right here!

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:06.570
Save me, Rikyū!

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:18.230
Rikyū! Rikyū! Rikyū!!!

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:31.500
Sign: The early bird gets the worm.

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:31.840
You are a man of the past, Hechikan.

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:39.290
So pure, all the way to your death.

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:57.340
Now then... Who should I talk to?

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:06.520
Everytime I　

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:06.520
Anata no mune

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:08.910
feel your heart

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:08.910
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:15.000
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:15.000
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:21.180
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:21.180
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:27.340
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:27.340
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:33.430
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:33.430
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.310
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.310
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:40.890
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:40.890
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:46.760
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:46.760
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.760
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.760
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:52.370
Without each other.

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:52.370
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:53.330
You should

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:53.330
Soshite

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:58.830
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:58.830
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:02.620
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:02.620
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.680 --> 00:24:08.330
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.680 --> 00:24:08.330
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:14.820
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:14.820
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:20.620
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:20.620
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:26.600
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:26.600
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:37.460
Nope!

00:24:41.460 --> 00:24:43.360
Hehehe!

00:24:47.360 --> 00:24:49.060
It's too late already...

00:24:49.210 --> 00:24:52.600
Anarchy in Japan.

00:24:53.340 --> 00:24:54.720
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.340 --> 00:24:58.070
That is the question.

00:24:56.570 --> 00:24:59.860
Anarchy in Japan
